   "line": [
    "a3"
   ],
   "spoken": "The only way to hold equality is the typical London prophylaxis a3, defusing the queenside — because otherwise grabbing the b-pawn walks into a knight to a4, and the queen is trapped.",
   "kind": "tactic",
   "reanchor": true
  },
  {
